---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Ruhani Creations by Sumati"
  description="Terms and conditions for Ruhani Creations by Sumati covering orders, pricing, delivery, customization, and support across its design-led collections."
>
  <main class="content-main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container page-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Terms & Conditions</p>
          <h1>Clear expectations around orders, customization, delivery, and support.</h1>
          <p class="page-intro">These terms explain how orders are discussed and confirmed through Ruhani Creations by Sumati across clothing, hand-painted accents, archive references, and future design categories. Last updated: March 19, 2026.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-mark-card">
          <img class="page-mark" src="/assets/generated/rcbs-emblem-dark.png" alt="Ruhani Creations by Sumati emblem">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container page-stack">
      <section class="page-panel">
        <div class="policy-grid">
          <article class="policy-card">
            <span class="policy-tag">Orders</span>
            <h3>Subject to confirmation</h3>
            <p>Availability, final price, and customization scope are confirmed directly with the studio before any order is treated as accepted.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="policy-card">
            <span class="policy-tag">Payments</span>
            <h3>Advance may apply</h3>
            <p>Custom or made-to-order work may require an advance payment. Order processing starts only after payment confirmation.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="policy-card">
            <span class="policy-tag">Returns</span>
            <h3>Custom pieces are limited</h3>
            <p>Customized pieces are generally non-returnable except where the delivered product materially differs from the confirmed order.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="page-panel policy-article">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Product display and catalog presentation</h2>
          <p>The website is intended to present current and recent styles, reference pricing, and brand information. Colours may vary slightly based on lighting, screen settings, or photography.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>2. Availability and order acceptance</h2>
          <p>Products shown on the site are subject to availability at the time of inquiry. An item is not reserved until the studio confirms availability and the order details have been accepted directly with you.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>3. Pricing and customization</h2>
          <p>Catalog prices may be revised depending on size changes, design changes, custom work, or add-on finishing. Sample discounts shown on the site are for catalog display planning and do not substitute a direct order confirmation.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>4. Payments</h2>
          <p>Payment terms are shared directly during order confirmation. For custom work or specially prepared pieces, full or partial advance payment may be requested before work begins.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>5. Delivery and timelines</h2>
          <p>Delivery timelines are estimates. Ready inventory, customization, transport conditions, and courier timelines can affect the final schedule. The studio is not responsible for delays caused by courier partners or circumstances outside reasonable control.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>6. Returns, exchanges, and issue reporting</h2>
          <p>If you believe an item was delivered damaged or materially incorrect, notify us as soon as reasonably possible with photos and order context. Ready inventory concerns are reviewed case by case. Customized orders are generally non-returnable unless the studio confirms a clear issue with fulfillment.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>7. Contact</h2>
          <p>For questions related to these terms, contact <a href="mailto:support@ruhanicreationsbysumati.com">support@ruhanicreationsbysumati.com</a> or message us on <a href="https://wa.me/919105114152" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>